[quote=qianxun;60307244]Sure thing, just put in an order for how much you want. Tartakum was using the ZTZ-65, which is a fairly old design. Dirt cheap too, just 2.5 million Vespurian dollars (or around 142 million Qianxun yuan). However, it can be modernized with a better tank gun, fire control systems, night optics, NBC protection, that kind of stuff.

Alternatively you might want to consider my actual export tank, the ZTZ-18, which was designed by SummitONE Solutions. It's 5 million Vespurian dollars per unit. It's technically a third-generation tank, but fitted with tech you can ascribe to the fourth-generation.[/quote]
